{"articleNo":"55332","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=55332&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"제 32주년 개교기념일(5/22) 휴강 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2012.05.16","hit":"7589","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 제 32주년 개교기념일&nbsp;휴강 안내</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp; </span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;오는 5월 22일(화)은 우리학교 32주년 개교기념일입니다.</span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;개교&nbsp;기념일은 우리 학교&nbsp;수업을 휴강하며 6월 12일(화)이 보강 날짜로 지정되어 있습니다.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;휴보강 관련 내역은 홈페이지 \"금오인-학사정보-개설과목안내\"의&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">강의별&nbsp;\"휴보강내역\"에서 </span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 확인할 수 있습니다. </span></p><p>&nbsp; </p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2012.05.16</span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\">&nbsp;</p></span><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;교 무 처 장</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
